{"channelId":"UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","row":["Animal Rescue",289,"🌿 Welcome to Animal Rescue – your haven for exciting and heartwarming animal rescues from around the world! 🌍\n\nExplore real-life rescue stories with cinematic visuals and AI-powered storytelling. Each video shows animals in distress and the heroes who save them, facing challenges like dangerous parasites.\n\n🌬️ With a relaxing ASMR-style experience, every rescue is presented from a first-person perspective, making you feel as if you're there, offering care and healing. From life-or-death situations to moments of recovery, our journey immerses you in the miracle of animal rescue.\n\n⚠️ Be inspired by the strength and courage of the animals and their rescuers. Join us in sharing hope, empathy, and the power of change!\n\n🔔 Subscribe to be part of a movement that makes a difference every day!\n\nDisclaimer: The content on this channel is for entertainment and is not meant to deceive. The stories are created using advanced methods to highlight the bond between humans and animals.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:05.804Z","channelId":"UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c21d2b53e1ed7c7cb817cba5044088f98d8c104fa01f88759553908396250376","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f49f1e8668cca717a8df7674d106083d673278aa3ed57f273fa2256ed7e3e5f3"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:05.804Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":289,"raw":"289 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCFT8d-cNyoZFSMQjbB3dpg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:05.804Z"}],"emails":[],"